<title>THAILAND: Bank of Asia up deposit rates 25 points.</title>
<headline>Bank of Asia up deposit rates 25 points.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Asia Plc said on Thursday it had raised its three-month fixed deposit rates by 25 basis points, effective February 19.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement the hike raised its three-month rates to a 10.25-11.25 percent range from 10.00-11.00 earlier.</p>
<p>Bank of Asia's six and 12-month fixed deposit rates remained unchanged in a 10.00-11.00 percent range, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
